OL,3,GNEWSAManchester Storm ready for
OL,4,A'emotional' homecoming
OL,5,
OL,6,FManchester Storm said the team is
OL,7,Fpreparing for an "emotional" return as
OL,8,Fthe city prepares to welcome them home
OL,9,Ffor the first time in 24 years.
OL,11,FThe team will face Sheffield Steelers
OL,12,Fin a pre-season game at 16:00 BST on
OL,13,FSunday at Manchester's AO Arena.
OL,15,FIt comes after they left Planet Ice in
OL,16,FAltrincham.
OL,18,FThe club said it was looking like it
OL,19,Fwas going to be a bumper crowd and
OL,20,Fcould even set a new record attendance
OL,21,Fby any Elite Ice Hockey League team.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
